{
  "title": "Aromatic Spanish Almond Tarta De Santiago",
  "description": "A traditional Catalan dish featuring crunchy almonds and a hint of garlic, perfect for a brunch gathering, this recipe is diabetic friendly and made in the form of a tarta de santiago.",
  "cuisine": "Spanish",
